  "headline": "Calcium gluconate is not on FDA's current shortage list; the prior shortage posted 2021-03-24 is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show calcium gluconate is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21, and the earlier shortage first posted on 2021-03-24 has been resolved.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No public FDA signal exists at the plants for the recommended alternate manufacturer Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC was last inspected with a VAI classification on 2023-10-13, and HP Halden Pharma AS was last inspected with a VAI classification on 2023-05-10.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 866 vials of the 98 mg/mL 10 mL presentation with 34.5 days on hand at 25.1 vials per day.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 382 vials of the same presentation with 28.9 days on hand at 13.2 vials per day.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The next ranked alternatives are B. Braun Medical Inc. and Caplin Steriles Limited, neither of which is on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
